i>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Compiling the firmware</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Flashing the keyboard</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This doesn't require web search =
as it's based on established technical knowledge that wouldn't have changed=
 significantly.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div clas=
s=3D"grid-cols-1 grid gap-2.5 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0"><p class=3D"whitespac=
