ard with Vial-enabled QMK firmware from scratch.</p>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Prerequisites Se=
tup</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">1. Install QMK E=
nvironment</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">First, set up the QMK developmen=
t environment:</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Windows:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
