<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Download and install <a class=
=3D"underline" href=3D"https://msys.qmk.fm/">QMK MSYS</a></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">This includes all necessary too=
ls and dependencies</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>macOS:</strong></p>
<div class=3D"relative group/copy bg-bg-000/50 border-0.5 border-border-400=
