<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Flashing the Key=
board</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">9. Enter Bootloa=
der Mode</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Put your Sofle into bootloader m=
ode:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Physical Reset Button</=
strong>: Press the reset button on the PCB (usually on the bottom)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Bootmagic</strong>: Hol=
d down the top-left key while plugging in the keyboard</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Keymap Reset</strong>: =
If already programmed, press the reset key combination</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">10. Flash the Fi=
rmware</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Using QMK Toolbox (Recom=
mended for beginners):</strong></p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Download <a class=3D"underline"=
 href=3D"https://github.com/qmk/qmk_toolbox/releases">QMK Toolbox</a></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Open QMK Toolbox</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Select your compiled firmware f=
ile</li>
