<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">11. Flash Both H=
alves</h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Important</strong>: For =
split keyboards, you need to flash both halves:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Flash the left half first (usua=
lly the master)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Disconnect and flash the right =
half</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Some Sofle versions may require=
 setting handedness in the firmware</li>
</ol>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Post-Flash Setup=
</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">12. Test with Vi=
al GUI</h3>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Download <a class=3D"underline"=
 href=3D"https://get.vial.today/">Vial</a></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Connect your keyboard</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Vial should automatically detec=
t your Sofle</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You can now configure layouts, =
macros, and layers through the GUI</li>
</ol>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Troubleshooting =
Tips</h2>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Keyboard not detected</=
strong>: Ensure you're in bootloader mode and have the correct drivers</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Compilation errors</str=
ong>: Check that all Vial files are properly formatted</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Split not working</stro=
ng>: Verify TRRS cable connection and that both halves are flashed</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Vial not recognizing</s=
trong>: Ensure the UID in config.h matches vial.json</li>
</ul>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Additional Consi=
derations</h2>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>OLED/Encoder support</s=
trong>: If your Sofle has OLEDs or encoders, ensure these are enabled in <c=
ode class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-=
000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">rules.mk=
</code></li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>RGB support</strong>: A=
dd RGB configuration if your board has underglow/per-key RGB</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Memory optimization</st=
rong>: Use <code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300=
 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9r=
em]">LTO_ENABLE =3D yes</code> to save space for Vial features</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Remember to back up your working=
 firmware and keymap files for future reference!</p></div></div><div class=
