<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">QMK MSYS is a pre-configured en=
vironment for Windows that includes:
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Git</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Python</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">ARM &amp; AVR toolchains</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Make and other build tools</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">QMK CLI pre-installed</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">However, <code class=3D"bg-text=
-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-w=
rap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">qmk setup</code> is still ne=
cessary because it:
