p-2.5 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0 p-3 pt-0 pr-8"><p class=3D"whitespace-normal b=
reak-words">The user is asking if they can enable everything in rules.mk ev=
en if they don't use all the features. This is generally not a good idea fo=
r several reasons:</p>
<ol class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-decimal space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Memory/space constraints - enab=
ling features uses flash memory and RAM</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Performance impact - more featu=
res can slow down the keyboard</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Conflicts - some features may c=
onflict with each other</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">The RP2040 Pro Micro they have =
has more space than ATmega32U4, but still has limits</li>
</ol>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">I should explain why this isn't =
recommended and what features are safe to enable vs which ones they should =
leave disabled.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div clas=
s=3D"grid-cols-1 grid gap-2.5 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0"><p class=3D"whitespac=
e-normal break-words"><strong>No, don't enable everything!</strong> Here's =
why:</p>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5">Problems with en=
abling everything:</h2>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">1. <strong>Memor=
y Overflow</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Each feature uses flash memory =
and RAM</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Too many features =3D firmware =
too big to fit</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You'll get compile errors like =
<code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-dange=
r-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">region=
 FLASH overflowed by X bytes</code></li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">2. <strong>Perfo=
rmance Issues</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">More features =3D slower keyboa=
rd response</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Can cause lag or missed keystro=
kes</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5">3. <strong>Featu=
re Conflicts</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Some features conflict:</p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><code class=3D"bg-text-200/5 bo=
rder border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap round=
ed-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ENCODER_ENABLE</code> + <code class=
=3D"bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 white=
space-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">ENCODER_MAP_ENABL=
E</code> (pick one)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Multiple RGB systems enabled to=
gether</li>
</ul>
