5 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0"><h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1=
 -mb-0.5"><strong>MOUSEKEY_ENABLE</strong></h2>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Lets you control your mouse curs=
or with your keyboard!</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>What it does:</strong></=
p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Move mouse cursor with keys</li=
>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Click mouse buttons</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Scroll wheel functions</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">All from your keyboard</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Example uses:</strong></=
p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Map arrow keys on a layer to mo=
ve mouse</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Use WASD for gaming-style mouse=
 movement</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Have keys for left/right click<=
/li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Scroll without reaching for mou=
se</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Should you enable it?</s=
trong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Yes if you want occasional mous=
e control without moving your hands</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No if you never see yourself us=
ing it (saves ~2KB space)</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 class=3D"text-xl font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5"><strong>ENCODER_=
ENABLE</strong></h2>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">For rotary encoders (knobs) on y=
our keyboard!</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>What it does:</strong></=
p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Supports rotating knobs/dials</=
li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Common uses: volume control, sc=
rolling, layer switching</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Push-button function if encoder=
 has a click</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>For Sofle:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Sofle keyboards often have 1-2 =
encoder spots</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Usually where the inner thumb k=
eys are</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Not all Sofle builds include en=
coders</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Check if you have encode=
rs:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Look for circular knobs on your=
 keyboard</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Or empty circular footprints on=
 PCB</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Should you enable it?</s=
trong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Yes</strong> if you hav=
e encoders installed</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>No</strong> if you don'=
