e firmware.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><div class=3D=
"grid-cols-1 grid gap-2.5 [&amp;_&gt;_*]:min-w-0"><h2 class=3D"text-xl font=
-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-0.5"><strong>QMK_SETTINGS</strong></h2>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Runtime configuration storage - =
lets you change settings without reflashing!</p>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>What it =
does:</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Saves settings to EEPROM (persi=
stent memory)</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Change configurations through k=
eycodes/Vial</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Settings persist after unpluggi=
ng</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>What set=
tings?</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Auto Shift timeout</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Tapping term</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Mouse key speeds</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Combo term</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">One shot timeout</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Other QMK behaviors</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>Without =
QMK_SETTINGS:</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Settings are hardcoded in firmw=
are</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Need to recompile &amp; reflash=
 to change</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Fixed values for everyone</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>With QMK=
_SETTINGS:</strong></h3>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Adjust settings on-the-fly</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Personalize keyboard behavior</=
li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">No reflashing needed</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>Memory c=
ost:</strong> ~2-4KB</h3>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>Should y=
ou enable it?</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Enable if:</strong></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You use features like Auto Shif=
t, Tap Dance, etc.</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You want to fine-tune timing se=
ttings</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Multiple people use the keyboar=
d</li>
</ul>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Keep disabled if:</stron=
g></p>
<ul class=3D"[&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:p=
b-1 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-7">
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You're happy with default timin=
gs</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You need the memory space</li>
<li class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">You don't use advanced QMK feat=
ures</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"text-lg font-bold text-text-100 mt-1 -mb-1.5"><strong>With Via=
l:</strong></h3>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words">Since Vial already lets you chan=
ge layouts dynamically, QMK_SETTINGS is less critical. Vial handles the imp=
ortant stuff (keys, macros) while QMK_SETTINGS handles the timing/behavior =
tweaks.</p>
<p class=3D"whitespace-normal break-words"><strong>Verdict:</strong> Usuall=
y not needed with Vial unless you're a power user who wants to tweak every =
timing parameter!</p></div></div><div class=3D"flex flex-col gap-2 py-2"></=
